<!--T:1-->
The inputs and outputs of the module that [[Special:MyLanguage/Approvals|Approvals]] uses.

<!--T:2-->
== Inputs ==
{| class="wikitable"
! Name !! Default !! Description
|-
| <code>repository</code> || || The repository whose workflow plans and applies.
|-
| <code>environments</code> || || One environment per workspace, named after it.
|-
| <code>auto_apply</code> || <code>[]</code> || Environments that apply without an approval, like HCP Terraform's auto apply. List the same workspaces in the action's <code>auto-apply</code> input.
|-
| <code>reviewer_teams</code> || <code>[]</code> || IDs of the teams whose approval starts an apply.
|-
| <code>reviewer_users</code> || <code>[]</code> || IDs of the users whose approval starts an apply.
|-
| <code>organization_team</code> || <code>null</code> || A team to create in the repository's organization, with read access to the repository, and add to the reviewers: <code>name</code>, and optionally <code>description</code>, <code>members</code> and <code>maintainers</code> as GitHub usernames. Leave it out for a repository a user owns, since only organizations have teams.
|-
| <code>prevent_self_review</code> || <code>false</code> || Whether the person who started the run is barred from approving its apply. Leave it off when one person does both.
|-
| <code>can_admins_bypass</code> || <code>false</code> || Whether repository administrators may start an apply without an approval.
|-
| <code>gate_check</code> || <code>"tofu gate"</code> || The name of the gate job, made a required check of the default branch through a ruleset. <code>null</code> leaves the branch alone.
|}

<!--T:3-->
At least one reviewer team or user, or <code>organization_team</code>, is required, unless every environment is in <code>auto_apply</code>.

<!--T:4-->
== Outputs ==
{| class="wikitable"
! Name !! Description
|-
| <code>environments</code> || The environments, by workspace.
|-
| <code>organization_team_id</code> || The ID of the team made from <code>organization_team</code>, or <code>null</code>.
|}
</translate>

